#: ../../source/guides/devops/fingerprints.rst:146
msgid ""
"The ``test-*`` targets were renamed when this was built, and **no aliases were "
"kept**: ``test-full`` is now ``test-rust``, ``test-tools`` is ``test-python``, and "
"their variants follow. ``docs-coverage`` is ``docs-site-coverage``, because that name"
" claimed something it does not measure."
msgstr ""
"Os targets ``test-*`` foram renomeados quando isto foi construído, e **nenhum apelido"
" foi mantido**: ``test-full`` agora é ``test-rust``, ``test-tools`` é ``test-"
"python``, e as variantes deles seguem junto. O ``docs-coverage`` é ``docs-site-"
"coverage``, porque aquele nome afirmava algo que ele não mede."

